      "locator_count": 14,
      "claims": [
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-001",
          "claim_type": "analyst_question",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:bf94016b54ed5b73fafe9610eccdd2354c89cdc7417dfc0554b8dc29a136b30f"
          ],
          "modality": "question",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "Satya, maybe I'll start away from the numbers and ask if you could spend a minute and elaborate on your opening comments about model choice and the protection of corporate IP."
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-002",
          "claim_type": "analyst_question",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:8af8e3503cebdc0d93bf5e2bcb8afccb142eb3d3a2d85b924ec68d28ef65d011"
          ],
          "modality": "question",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "First, how material do you think traction could be for open and custom models over the next year or 2, knowing that many enterprises might be initially reticent to use open models?"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-003",
          "claim_type": "analyst_question",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:f57e73b2309ce7f310d32097ef12478e371ede63768b7a15bb4e1b5e777fa992"
          ],
          "modality": "question",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "And secondly, how exactly does Microsoft benefit from this shift knowing that you've also got fairly large frontier lab exposure?"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-004",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:3aa1905fd9840948ab2716fef2719bf3f882ab6d01cf4058c65cb3c9cb4742d7"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "You will maybe need multiple models to even remediate some challenges that get caused by one model, right?"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-005",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:481ebb454d018c9b2393ff604888958f7d1b201cf7b4759bc0b3ba248f64a44f"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "And the models are an input not some extraction of the knowledge of the enterprise."
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-006",
          "claim_type": "analyst_question",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:5041552376d771a855aa1bdcb3d6d51e38ddb7dbb65e922056bb8cd5f41f2150"
          ],
          "modality": "question",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "Amy, impressive acceleration in Azure up to 43% going to mid-40s. I guess the questions around the underlying drivers, what you and Satya are seeing in terms of just what's driving this and mainly the question is around capacity constraints."
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-007",
          "claim_type": "analyst_question",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:7445f96b994fb480ae5b3cf3b2e6ba8c37c7889998f054ae9c8441565fac460f"
          ],
          "modality": "question",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "Are we just still in the same environment?"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-008",
          "claim_type": "analyst_question",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:d8ebe121b24372db7cc462f5defb9ce5174d9c65c346e969a28d26529b48714d"
          ],
          "modality": "question",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "Or is this Microsoft just executing better given the constraints we're all seeing?"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-009",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:61fa6ff1ee9820beaf072b237b63be47655be8c0eb2a87fdd8da3a52a000e206"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "And because of the supply-demand imbalance, we've been talking about, when we can make efficiency gains, they are quickly monetized in quarter."
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-010",
          "claim_type": "analyst_question",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:edc742b449b9d3cb07b3b970c88dd1238156cd16316e328ccbb83ef2128851e9"
          ],
          "modality": "question",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "How does Microsoft protect itself if there really is overcapacity and overbuilding of data centers or overbuilding of chips, et cetera?"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-011",
          "claim_type": "analyst_question",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:cd6e781b01025a55685aa290faf1ffe7f26e8ea2f4e4103ea408356a50be9478"
          ],
          "modality": "question",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "And on the flip side of that, how do you manage through the hardware price increases that we're seeing, the component prices and that it doesn't just drive you to either massively drive up the price of your offerings or negatively impact your margins?"
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-012",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:b782dc596ab0ab8b5ead4b349fb977c115bbc71385961d99cc8b6dfb96202bf4"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "Currently, the situation is obviously that demand exceeds available supply in a sort of relatively extreme moment."
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-013",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:6b340b90b37544e082110b6b7e8a18a7aa47921987ddf9530e6ba9074823e047"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "It starts with model choice."
        },
        {
          "claim_id": "claim-014",
          "claim_type": "company_statement",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "urn:company-wiki:evidence-span:sha256:ca6b4dd15adec072eda99f43b60b9d8134fffde90b03207211858119ccfca1b3"
          ],
          "modality": "actual",
          "needs_review": false,
          "text": "Beyond model choice, data, and context, we are building Foundry as the complete app and agent stack."
        }
      ],
